; 3 va undan ko'p — 3,0. 2026-yil tarifida avariyasiz haydash uchun chegirma yo'q — toza tarix bazaviy tarifni anglatadi."}]}]]}],["$","$L24","4",{"value":"faq-4","children":[["$","$L25",null,{"className":"text-left text-foreground","children":"OSAGOni onlayn rasmiylashtirish mumkinmi?"}],["$","$L26",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground","children":"Ha, OSAGO polisini sug'urta kompaniyalari saytlari orqali onlayn sotib olish mumkin."}]}]]}],["$","$L24","5",{"value":"faq-5","children":[["$","$L25",null,{"className":"text-left text-foreground","children":"OSAGOni qaysi sug'urta kompaniyalaridan xarid qilish mumkin?"}],["$","$L26",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground","children":"O'zbekistondagi yetakchi sug'urtachilar: Kafolat, Uzagrosugurta, Alskom, Apex Insurance, Gross Insurance, Inson, Trust Insurance. Stavkalar O'zbekiston Respublikasi Moliya vazirligi tomonidan tasdiqlangan va bir xil — farq xizmat sifatida."}]}]]}],["$","$L24","6",{"value":"faq-6","children":[["$","$L25",null,{"className":"text-left text-foreground","children":"OSAGO yo'q haydovchi jarima qancha?"}],["$","$L26",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground","children":"Polis qamramagan davrda boshqarish uchun Ma'muriy javobgarlik kodeksining 135-1-moddasi bo'yicha ogohlantirish yoki 0,5 BHK jarima (hozir 220 000 so'm). Baxtsiz hodisada zarar o'z hisobingizdan to'lanadi."}]}]]}]]}]]}]
